✅ DoneIt — Enterprise Workflow Management System

DoneIt is a role-based enterprise workflow management system built using the MERN stack.
It is designed to manage tasks, users, and workflows across different organizational roles with proper authentication, authorization, and auditability.

This project is built with real-world architecture principles, not as a demo or tutorial app.

🚀 Features
🔐 Authentication & Authorization

JWT-based authentication

Secure password hashing using bcrypt

Persistent login across refresh

Role-based access control (RBAC)

Auto logout on token expiry

👥 User Roles

Admin

Full system access

User management

Audit log access

Manager

Create & manage tasks

View team tasks

Employee

View assigned tasks only

🗂 Task Management

Create, update, delete tasks (admin/manager)

Role-aware task visibility

Task status & priority tracking

Secure backend enforcement (not just frontend)

🔔 Notifications

User-specific notifications

Read/unread status

Backend-persisted notifications

📜 Audit Logs (Admin Only)

User signup

User login

Task creation, update, deletion

Centralized audit trail for accountability

🧱 Tech Stack
Frontend

React + Vite

Tailwind CSS

Zustand (state management)

Axios (API layer)

React Router

Backend

Node.js

Express.js

MongoDB + Mongoose

JWT Authentication

bcrypt (password hashing)

🏗 Architecture Overview
Backend (MVC Pattern)
backend/
 ├── src/
 │   ├── controllers/
 │   ├── models/
 │   ├── routes/
 │   ├── middlewares/
 │   └── utils/
 ├── server.js

Frontend
frontend/
 ├── src/
 │   ├── pages/
 │   ├── components/
 │   ├── stores/
 │   ├── api/
 │   └── hooks/

⚙️ Setup Instructions
1️⃣ Clone Repository
git clone https://github.com/Singhsaditya/DoneIt.git
cd DoneIt

2️⃣ Backend Setup
cd backend
npm install
npm run dev


Create a .env file in backend/:

MONGO_URI=your_mongodb_connection_string
JWT_SECRET=your_jwt_secret
PORT=5000

3️⃣ Frontend Setup
cd ../frontend
npm install
npm run dev


Frontend runs on:

http://localhost:8080


Backend runs on:

http://localhost:5000

🔑 API Overview
Auth

POST /api/auth/signup

POST /api/auth/login

GET /api/auth/me

Tasks

GET /api/tasks

POST /api/tasks (admin/manager)

PUT /api/tasks/:id

DELETE /api/tasks/:id (admin)

Notifications

GET /api/notifications

PUT /api/notifications/:id/read

Audit Logs

GET /api/audit (admin only)

🧠 Design Decisions

Zustand chosen for lightweight, scalable state management

Backend-enforced RBAC for real security

Centralized error handling for production readiness

Audit logs to simulate enterprise compliance needs

📈 Future Improvements

Real-time notifications (WebSockets)

Task comments & attachments

SLA breach alerts

Team-based task grouping

Refresh token rotation

